1
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:04,180
大门前家庭欢乐集会 麻溜的
Family fun meeting by the front door, stat!

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,920
"麻溜的"意思就是马上
"Stat" means right now!

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,520
怎么啦
Ugh. What is it?

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,920
别理她 她一整天都心情不好
Ignore her. She's been in a bad mood all day.

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,860
卢克根本不在家
And Luke isn't home yet.

6
00:00:12,004 --> 00:00:13,154
我就在这儿呢
Oh. I'm right here.

7
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,480
你刚刚上哪儿去了
Where were you?

8
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,380
这房子依然充满秘密啊
This house still holds its secrets.

9
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:19,040
你们应该很好奇我为什么叫你们过来
You're probably wondering why I called you all here.

10
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,820
-一点也不 -现在可以停止好奇
- Nope. - Well, stop your wondering...

11
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:21,480
我们不好奇
We're not wondering.

12
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,940
拭目以待 这个奇观吧
and behold.... this wonder!

13
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,229
我的天呐 不是吧
oh, my god! Seriously?

14
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,540
我卖了套房给独一无二的皮特·约翰逊
I sold a home to the one and only Pete Johnson.

15
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,000
世上只有一个皮特·约翰逊吗
There's only one Pete Johnson?

16
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,180
叫这名的加州顶级房车经销商就一个
Only one who's California's top R.V. dealer.

17
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,820
另有835个呢 要签下售车合同简直是噩梦
There's 835 others. Nightmare of a deal to paper.

18
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,860
所以这是要表达
Well, and this was his way of saying...

19
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,100
-感谢 -当然了
- Thank you. - Of course.

20
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,168
他付佣金了是不是
he paid a commission, too, right?

21
00:00:41,168 --> 00:00:44,458
没错 他还说我随时都能把乔琳开出去
Yes. And he told me I could take Iolene out anytime.

22
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:45,880
没错 我给她起名字了
Yeah, I named her!

23
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,360
我们开这小骚车去海岸转转吧
Let's take this dirty girl for a spin up the coast!

24
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,080
-好耶 -太赞了 相当不错吧
- Yes! - Awesome! Pretty sweet, huh?

25
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:51,540
没错
Yeah!

26
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,600
我可以预见接下来会怎样了
I can see where this is going.

27
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,060
今年夏天 你 我和孩子们
This summer--you, me, the kids,

28
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,320
黄石国家公园
Yellowstone National Park.

29
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:02,720
这还只是辆维罗纳 他还让我开阿玛菲款的呢
And that's just the Verona, he offered me an Amalfi.

30
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,160
阿玛菲呀 克莱尔
An Amalfi, Claire!

31
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,880
那会让安布里亚像波特菲诺一样[意大利城市]
That makes the Umbria look like a Portofino!

32
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,879
他们不该称之为罗马帝国
Well, they should've called it the Roman,

33
00:01:07,879 --> 00:01:10,160
因为这是我们要做的事情
'cause that's what we're about to be doin'.

34
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:11,640
我都听不懂你的意思了
I'm really not following you.

35
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,420
跟孩子们来一段10天的旅程
Ten days on the road with those kids?

36
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:16,100
"万万"不行
Winnebag-no.

37
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:17,520
我超讨厌菲尔搞这些
I hate it when Phil does this.

38
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,840
现在我只能唱黑脸
Now I have to be the bad guy

39
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:21,340
介入其中 粉碎他的"美妙"主意
who comes in and squelches his brilliant idea.

40
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,960
我说了不行 把那玩意儿从我家里牵出去
I said no. Get it out of my house.

41
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:24,680
好吧
Fine.

42
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:26,380
走吧 乔琳
Come on, Jolene.

43
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:30,220
好在 这一次
Fortunately, this time,

44
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:31,640
我不用再特意扫他的兴了
I don't have to be the wet blanket,

45
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:34,180
因为只要上海岸边小转一圈
Because even on just a short spin up the coast,

46
00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:36,840
菲尔就会看到我每天都要面对的
Phil will see what I see every day--

47
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,700
孩子们一被关进车里
The transformation that happens

48
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:41,240
就会闹得天翻地覆
when our kids are locked in a moving metal box...

49
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,580
犹如被解锁出笼的海怪
The kraken that is unleashed.

50
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:46,280
我其实非常非常爱我的孩子们
I love my kids very, very much.

51
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,300
-你戳疼我了 -是啊 我知道 宝贝
- You're poking me. - Yeah, well, I know, sweetie.

52
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,660
但如果我不把发夹弄好
But I don't get these pins just right,

53
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,280
你的发髻就会在表演时散下来
your bun could fall out during your routine,

54
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,600
那样就会影响你的发挥
and it could mess you up.

55
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:06,820
好吧 来试看看
Okay, let's test it out.

56
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:08,340
好了
All right.

57
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,460
跳
Jump.

58
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:10,920
很好 转圈
Good. Spin.

59
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,720
来个碧昂斯的动作
Now give me Beyonce.

60
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,380
好了 我只能帮到这里了
Okay, I've done everything I can do.

61
00:02:16,380 --> 00:02:17,000
接下来靠你自己了
It's up to you now.

62
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,660
我们家里出了个体操运动员
We have a gymnast in our family.

63
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,360
没错 莉莉去上体操班
Yeah, Lily goes to gymnastics class.

64
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,340
在短短一年内
In one short year,

65
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:23,220
我已见证了她从一个
I've seen her blossom from a little girl

66
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:24,600
完全不会翻跟斗的小姑娘
who couldn't do a somersault...

67
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,420
进步到现在 算是会了吧
into one who... kind of can.

68
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,040
是啊 以那标准来看 我们家里还有
Yeah, and by that standard, we also have a black belt,

69
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,231
柔道黑段 艺术天才 和首席芭蕾演员呢
art prodigy, and prima ballerina in our family, so...

70
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,580
但我们家里缺少
You know, what we don't have in our family

71
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,020
两位慈爱 支持的父亲
is two loving, supportive fathers.

72
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:35,500
我只是想强调她才5岁 明白嘛
I'm just saying, she's 5, you know?

73
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,280
你老是提醒她这点
And you never let her forget it.

74
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,540
-打扰一下 那是你女儿吗 -是啊
- Excuse me, is that your little girl out there? - It is.

75
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,200
-你帮她扎的头发 -是啊
- And you did her hair? - I did.

76
00:02:42,380 --> 00:02:44,840
你能帮我女儿朱莉也做个一样的发型吗
Do you mind helping my Julie with hers?

77
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,940
你们是开敞篷车过来的吗
Oh, do you guys own a convertible?

78
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:49,380
-不是 -我无意评判
- No. - Oh, no judgment.

79
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,160
等莉莉表演完 我就帮你弄
Yeah, I'll get to work right when Lily's done.

80
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:00,480
不错 结尾的跳跃是新式的
Not bad. That little leap at the end--that's new.

81
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,540
她真的表现得好好
She's getting really good.

82
00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:04,280
你最好给我拿出最好的表现来
You better bring your "A" Game.

83
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,920
天呐 小卡快瞧 莉莉第二了 9.2分
Oh, my god. Cam, look. Lily's in second place. 9.2.

84
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,080
我早跟你说了她是个体操运动员
I told you she's a gymnast.

85
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,720
分数这么高 她能进预选队了
With scores like that, she's gonna make pre-team.

86
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,540
你是说真的吗
Are you serious?

87
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:14,393
预选队 她能进预...什么是预选队
Pre-team? She could make pre-- what's pre-team?

88
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:16,540
克莱尔
Claire!

89
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:18,720
菲尔
Phil!

90
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:19,720
海莉
Haley!

91
00:03:20,980 --> 00:03:21,420
卢克
Luke!

92
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:22,860
艾丽克斯
Alex!

93
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:25,020
歌洛莉亚 我们把全家人的名字都喊过三遍了
Gloria, we've been through the roster three times.

94
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,020
他们不在家
They're not home.

95
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:28,080
但他们的车在呢 能上哪儿去呢
But their cars are here. Where could they be?

96
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:29,600
谁知道这些人在搞什么
Who knows what these people do?

97
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,220
但我的书包在里面 杰
But my backpack is in there, Jay,

98
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:32,520
里面有我要在诗歌朗诵会上读的诗
My poem for my poetry reading.

99
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:34,220
别激动 难道你没在电脑上备份吗
Calm down. Didn't you back it up on your computer?

100
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,200
什么样的人会用电脑写诗啊
What kind of man writes poetry on a computer?

101
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,761
你该问 什么样的人还写诗啊
You could've ended that sentence after "Poetry."

102
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:43,260
进来 别问我怎么进的
Come in. And no questions.

103
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:47,660
我的书包不在楼上
My backpack wasn't upstairs.

104
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:48,920
那是什么
What's that?

105
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:51,400
克莱尔的朋友寄给她的明信片 叫瑞秋
Postcard from a friend of Claire's--Rachel.

106
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,600
"在科苏梅尔岛的地中海俱乐部享受人生呢"
"Living it up in Club Med Cozumel."

107
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,860
看来这人的婚姻是泡汤了
Looks like that marriage went down the drain.

108
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,580
另外有个更爆炸的消息
In other shocking news,

109
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,120
菲尔订了一份蹦床杂志
Phil subscribes to a trampoline magazine.

110
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:01,620
偷看别人的信件...
Going through other people's mail--

111
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:02,920
注意素质修养 杰
Keeping it classy, Jay.

112
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,600
妈 我的书包不在卢克房间
Mom, my backpack isn't in Luke's room.

113
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:07,540
我在这边也没看到
I don't see it in here, either.

114
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,440
我觉得那地方塞不下吧
I don't think it would fit in there.

115
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,944
我进来的时候它开着
Ay, this was open when I came in.

116
00:04:11,380 --> 00:04:13,300
我就找片阿司匹林
I was just looking for an aspirin.

117
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:16,060
我刚刚似乎听到了什么动静
I thought that I heard some noises.

118
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,180
承认吧 你就是在窥探
So you were snooping?

119
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:19,226
这就算窥探了
Oh, so now it's snooping,

120
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:20,760
我只是想更了解我的家人
Wanting to know more about your family

121
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,620
翻翻他们的生活用品而已
by looking through their personal things?

122
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:25,400
不是就现在 打世界上有东西起你就这样
Not just now. Since the invention of things.

123
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,320
那是克莱尔做的布朗尼吗
Is that one of Claire's brownies?

124
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:29,120
不是 可好吃了 肯定是小卡做的
No, they're delicious. Must be Cam's.

125
00:04:29,260 --> 00:04:31,060
-噢不 -别担心 还有呢
- Oh, no. - Don't worry. There's more.

126
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,400
不 我想起我的书包在哪里了
No! That's where my backpack is.

127
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:35,380
小卡送我和卢克回的家
Cam drove me and Luke home.

128
00:04:35,626 --> 00:04:37,100
我肯定是落在他车里了
I must've left it in his car.

129
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:38,400
你最近怎么总是丢三落四的
Why are you so scattered lately?

130
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:42,020
他只是很紧张今晚的诗歌朗诵会
Aw, he's just nervous because of his poetry reading tonight.

131
00:04:42,402 --> 00:04:44,000
但别担心 宝贝
But don't worry, papi.

132
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,280
我会去现场支持你的
I am going to be there to support you.

133
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,320
我不想我妈过去
I don't want my mom there.

134
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,700
我正在探索一些暗黑题材
I'm exploring some darker themes

135
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,080
我觉得她还没准备好接受
I'm not sure she's ready for,

136
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:54,820
我写的诗有《脐带》
Poems like "The umbilical noose,"

137
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:56,440
《名叫妈妈的监狱》
"A jail called mom,"

138
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:57,920
《窒息的本性》
"Smother nature."

139
00:04:58,575 --> 00:05:00,704
她肯定会往她自己身上扯
She'll just find some way to make it all about her.

140
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:06,740
给乖女儿海莉把温度调到舒适的75度
And a toasty 75 degrees for daughter Haley.

141
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,540
知道不
You see,

142
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:11,620
维罗纳宝车能对温度进行对点调节 克莱尔
the Verona boasts individualized climate zones, Claire.

143
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:15,460
我完全可以把北极熊和兰花一起放车里
I could literally transport a polar bear and an orchid

144
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:16,940
而不用运两次
and not make two trips.

145
00:05:17,775 --> 00:05:20,902
爸 我冻死了 感觉我这才1度
Dad, I'm freezing. It's, like, 1 degree back here.

146
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,720
上车6分钟 好戏开场了
Six minutes in, and it begins.

147
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:26,840
给 我从床上给你拿了条毯子
Here. Take the blanket from the bed.

148
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:28,140
谢谢老姐
Thanks, Kitten.

149
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,160
爸 能换首歌吗
Dad, can you change the music?

150
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:31,080
那还用说
Can I?

151
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,160
别啊别 这歌只会越来越吵
Oh, no. Oh, no, that's just getting louder.

152
00:05:34,168 --> 00:05:36,165
这不好 糟透了
This isn't good. It's not good at all.

153
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,020
事实上这棒极了
Actually, it's kind of perfect.

154
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:38,860
是吧
Right?

155
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,600
大窗户 古典乐
The big windows, the classical music.

156
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,680
跟在电影里一样
It's like we're in a movie.

157
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,420
开大点声 帅哥
Turn it up, handsome.

158
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,900
听你的
You got it!

159
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:52,220
显然一时的新奇劲儿推迟了必然的闹剧
Obviously, the novelty of the situation was delaying the inevitable.

160
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:55,100
但我不想在去黄石公园的半路上
But I didn't want to get halfway into a trip to Yellowstone

161
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:56,340
菲尔才幡然醒悟
before Phil discovered

162
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:58,600
他这是给孩子们造了多大的孽
what malevolent hellspawn we have for children...

163
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:00,660
我对孩子们是真爱
Whom I love very much.

164
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,840
艾丽克斯 宝贝 你的毛衣好好看
Alex, honey, that's a cute sweater.

165
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:05,940
貌似海莉也有一件差不多的
Doesn't Haley have one like that?

166
00:06:05,940 --> 00:06:07,080
就是她的
Oh, it actually is hers.

167
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,780
-我走之前从她衣柜顺的 -真的
- I took it from her closet before we left. - Really?

168
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:12,020
抱歉姑娘们 没想搞得你们不愉快的
Ooh. Sorry, girls. Didn't mean to start a whole thing.

169
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:16,120
我真不能忍 你穿我的衣服总是更好看
I am so sick of you always looking better in my clothes.

170
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,420
从什么时候起就这样了啊
When did that happen?

171
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:18,900
你一点都不介意吗
You're okay with this?

172
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:20,600
没事 她想穿什么穿什么
Oh, yeah. She can wear whatever she wants

173
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,840
反正我也穿了六个月了
After I've had it for six months.

174
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,080
或者你买件类似的 就自然送给我了
Or I get it automatically if you buy anything that looks like it.

175
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,520
感觉真是不错呢 是吧队友们
This just feels right. Huh, team?

176
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,940
事实上 我之前还想着
Matter of fact, I was thinking

177
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:32,060
我们一家子夏天可以驱车去黄石公园呢
we could all drive up to Yellowstone this summer.

178
00:06:32,060 --> 00:06:33,560
但我现在提议
But I say,

179
00:06:33,716 --> 00:06:36,900
我们开着这宝贝蛋跨越东西海岸吧
Let's take this beeyotch ocean to ocean!

180
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,440
-那太棒了 -赞啊
- That'd be cool! - Awesome!

181
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:39,700
那就说定啦
We're doing it!

182
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:41,160
菲尔 小心
Phil, the road!

183
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:47,300
我不知道我按了哪个按钮
I don't know what button I just pressed,

184
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,360
但真是爽死我了
But that was amazing.

185
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:55,840
我的书包肯定不在车里
My backpack's definitely not in there.

186
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:57,520
他们也不接电话
Well, they're not picking up their phone.

187
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,632
他肯定是带进屋了
He must've brought it inside.

188
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:01,660
抱歉 孩子 看来你只能自认倒霉了
Sorry, kid, looks like you're out of luck.

189
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:02,500
进来
Come!

190
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,740
他们难道都没装个防盗警报器吗
Don't they have a burglar alarm?

191
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:05,966
少废话
Ay, please.

192
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:09,080
好了大家 我们分头行动
Okay, everybody, split up and search.

193
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,360
杰 你去卧室找
Jay, you look in the bedroom.

194
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,500
我才不去基佬们的卧室呢
I'm not looking in their bedroom.

195
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,260
好吧
Fine.

196
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:14,840
妈 我的背包可不会在小卡的包里
Mom, I don't think my backpack is in Cam's bag.

197
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:16,300
我只是替他把包合上而已
I was just closing it for him.

198
00:07:16,928 --> 00:07:18,240
我 听到有动静
I... heard a noise.

199
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,740
看起来像他们办过一场小派对
Looks like the guys threw a little party.

200
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:20,840
我注意到了
I noticed.

201
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,560
他们都把客人专用香皂拿出来了
They brought out the guest soaps.

202
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,720
你这是来了多久了
How long have you been in here?

203
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:27,340
嘿 这是菲尔开公司的时候
Hey. This is that bottle of wine

204
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,180
我给他买的那瓶酒
I bought Phil when he started his company.

205
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:32,580
克莱尔的唇膏印还留在这些酒杯上
And Claire's lipstick is on many of these wineglasses.

206
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:34,000
看图猜词 他们昨晚是游戏之夜
Pictionary. They had game night?

207
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,600
可我们向来都参加游戏之夜的呀
But we always go to game night.

208
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:38,420
他奶奶的 他们抛弃了我们
Son of a bitch. They snubbed us.

209
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:40,540
找到了
Found it!

210
00:07:40,728 --> 00:07:43,243
肯定有好多人来玩
There must've been a dozen players.

211
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,100
胡娇也来了
Pepper was here.

212
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,520
可胡娇是爱我的呀
But Pepper loves me.

213
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,560
好了 搞定
Okay, she's all set.

214
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:51,640
我敢说你在馆里绝找不到更紧的发髻了[屁股]
I defy you to find a tighter bun in this gymnasium.

215
00:07:52,051 --> 00:07:53,937
你完全可以换种说法的
Lot of different ways you could've said that.

216
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,160
祝你自由体操好运 宝贝
Oh, and good luck on your floor routine, sweetie.

217
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:56,960
但你不用运气也很厉害了
Not that you need it.

218
00:07:58,980 --> 00:07:59,560
那是艾比
That's Abby.

219
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,860
她是班里最厉害的
She's the best in class.

220
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:02,337
她是我们的竞争对手
Oh. She's our competition.

221
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,980
我从没这么想要打败一个小孩过
I've never wanted to beat a kid so badly.

222
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,120
你没听到我说的吗
Are you not hearing these?

223
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:06,460
没有吗 好吧
No? Okay.

224
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,920
莉莉在平衡木上了
Oh, Lily's on the beam.

225
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:09,800
我好担心她的下马动作
I'm nervous about her dismount.

226
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,320
你说过她着地时能站稳 是吧
You said that she could stick the landing, right?

227
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:13,600
是的 只要她调整呼吸 依靠基本功
Yeah, as long as she breathes, relies on her training,

228
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:14,720
待在平衡木上
and stays in the zone.

229
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:16,820
我们是在说她要从6英寸的木头上下来
We are talking about her stepping off a 6-inch beam.

230
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,300
而且不摔倒 是的
And not falling. Right.

231
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,600
我不得不承认
I have to admit.

232
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:23,740
看到莉莉这么棒激发了我内心的一些情绪
Seeing Lily do so well brought out something in me.

233
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:25,680
是作为家长 自己的孩子不只是参与
The pride of being a parent of a child

234
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,360
而是表现卓越的骄傲感
who wasn't just participating but thriving.

235
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,400
好了 她要下马了
Okay, here comes her dismount.

236
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:34,360
稳住 莉莉 稳住
Stick it Lily. Stick it!

237
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,260
她站稳了
she stuck it!

238
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,300
她站稳了
She stuck it!

239
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,900
如果她的平衡木得分最高
If no one beat my daughter's score on the beam,

240
00:08:45,029 --> 00:08:46,723
她就能进预选队了
She would make pre-team.

241
00:08:47,258 --> 00:08:48,844
她就将成为健将中的一员
She'd be one of the elite.

242
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,620
骄傲感这玩意儿 真有意思
Funny thing, pride.

243
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:55,140
听说它产生于
They say it goeth before the...

244
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:56,460
摔下来 摔下来
Fall. Fall.

245
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,120
-摔倒 -米奇尔 我能听到你
- Fall. - Mitchell, I can hear you...

246
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,924
-什么 -在为一个小女生的摔倒加油
- What? - Rooting for a little girl to fall.

247
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,820
如果我能听到 别人也能听到
If I can hear you, other people can hear you.

248
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:02,880
好棒
Yes!

249
00:09:02,891 --> 00:09:05,488
我不知道自己为什么喝倒彩 抱歉
I don't know why I said that. I don't--I'm sorry.

250
00:09:05,488 --> 00:09:06,655
是的 他不是那个意思
Yeah, he didn't mean it.

251
00:09:06,655 --> 00:09:09,221
-我不是那个意思 -他是太投入了
- I didn't mean it. - No, um, he just got caught up.

252
00:09:09,571 --> 00:09:10,960
我们都知道
And, uh, you know,we all know

253
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:13,420
比赛让人疯狂
competition makes people do crazy things.So...

254
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:16,280
你看看 她的发髻在自由体操时散了
Look at this! Her bun fell apart during the floor exercise.

255
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:18,580
头发挡住了眼睛 动作都没法做完
Her hair got in her eyes and she couldn't even finish!

256
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:20,200
你故意的
You did it on purpose!

257
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,480
-不是 -老爸们
- No! - Daddies!

258
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:23,300
我是第一名哦
I'm in first place.

259
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:25,520
耶 真棒
Yay. That's great.

260
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,060
你得罪他们了吗
Did you offend them?

261
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,020
我 他们都很爱我
Me? They love me.

262
00:09:32,260 --> 00:09:34,800
我们能走了吗 我今晚还要诗朗诵呢
Can we go now? I have a poetry reading tonight.

263
00:09:35,620 --> 00:09:36,840
说到这个
And speaking of that,

264
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,940
-你们确定真的要去 -没道理啊
- Are you sure you guys really want-- - It makes no sense.

265
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:41,160
我们向来是每场派对的灵魂人物
We're always the life of every party.

266
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,820
可能他们没邀请你们
Maybe they didn't invite you

267
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:44,080
是因为你们是一对窥探狂
because you're a couple of snoops?

268
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,400
够啦 老好人先生
Okay, Mr. Goody two-shoes.

269
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,240
正常父母都会欣赏这一点
A trait normal parents would value.

270
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,300
杰 我觉得关于他 你说得对
Jay, I think you're right about him.

271
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:55,020
他作为一名小少年 最近太过于正直
He's been too good lately for a teenager.

272
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,380
那不正常
It's not normal.

273
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:58,520
我觉得这个世界就要
I am afraid that the world is going to--

274
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,462
天啊 这也太过分了
Oh, hell, no. This is too far. Ay.

275
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,500
看这个
Look at this.

276
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:04,760
那难道是...
Is that supposed to be...

277
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:05,820
就是我们俩
That's us.

278
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,600
我们不只是被抛弃了
Not only do we get blown off,

279
00:10:07,820 --> 00:10:09,280
他们还拿我们当笑料
now they're making fun of us.

280
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:12,394
我要给他们留个信
Well, I'm just gonna leave them a little message.

281
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,840
依我看
As far as I'm concerned,

282
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,160
他们都可以
They can all...

283
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:23,940
马嘴巴 好题目
Horse mouth! That's a good one!

284
00:10:23,940 --> 00:10:25,820
不是 "马嘴"可不是个短语
No, "Horse mouth" Is not an expression.

285
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:27,360
你看不懂吗
You can't get this?

286
00:10:27,636 --> 00:10:29,291
看 驴子
Look. Donkey.

287
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:31,280
-那可一点不像驴子 -看这驴耳朵
- That's not a donkey. - Look at the ears.

288
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,380
好吧 驴嘴
Okay. Donkey mouth!

289
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:34,880
你猜得太烂了
That's a terrible guess.

290
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,760
你画得太烂了
That's a terrible drawing!

291
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,560
他们不邀请我们 就因为你玩得太烂
We weren't invited because you stink at this game.

292
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:40,820
至少我会画画
At least I can draw!

293
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,300
打扰一下 请签收一下
Excuse me. Just need a signature.

294
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:43,220
拿来吧
Yeah, sure.

295
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:47,580
好吧
Okay.

296
00:10:48,832 --> 00:10:50,085
签好了
Here we go.

297
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:51,820
拿去吧 谢谢
There. Thank you.

298
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:52,380
好的
Yep.

299
00:10:54,140 --> 00:10:55,960
那不是签名 你这是画了只猫
That's not a signature. You drew a cat.

300
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,520
谢你八辈祖宗了啊
Thank you.

301
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:07,840
一派完美和谐的景象
Perfect freaking harmony.

302
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,520
我突然想明白了
That's when it hit me.

303
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:12,760
也许并不是封闭的车内空间
Maybe it's not the cold confines of a moving vehicle

304
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,180
让我的孩子们表现出顽劣捣蛋的一面
that brings out the worst in my kids.

305
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:17,660
而是我 让他们爆发出顽劣捣蛋的一面
Maybe I bring out the worst in them

306
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:19,420
因为没有风趣有爱的菲尔
when there's no fun-lovin' Phil around

307
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:20,800
来中和我的负能量
to neutralize my toxins.

308
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:22,920
那让我羞愧得无地自容
I was in a full shame spiral.

309
00:11:23,074 --> 00:11:24,441
有蜜蜂
Aah! A bee!

310
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:27,220
可就在这时 好事来了
And then something wonderful happened.

311
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:28,400
让我来
I got it!

312
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:30,780
-你个蠢货 -杀了它
- You idiot! - Kill it!

313
00:11:30,900 --> 00:11:31,800
不 别杀
No, don't!

314
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,640
你不知道蜜蜂是濒危动物吗
Haven't you heard of colony collapse?

315
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,340
蜜蜂快要灭绝了
Bees are endangered!

316
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,960
好啦孩子们 别乱动
Okay, guys, stand still.

317
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,500
只要你们不动 它就看不见你们
They can't see you if you're not moving.

318
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:38,780
它冲我来了
It's coming near me!

319
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,760
你把我当蜜蜂吗
Do I look like a bee?!

320
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,122
不 是我出手失误
No, that was an accident!

321
00:11:42,122 --> 00:11:43,597
那我也失误一回
Well, so is this!

322
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:47,700
大家淡定
Everyone remain calm!

323
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:50,040
我这就打开双棚天窗
I'll just open up the double-tilt swiss skylight

324
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,140
气流会把蜜蜂
and the airflow will pull

325
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,701
-抽出去的 -又来一只蜜蜂
- the bee out of-- - Aah! There's another bee now!

326
00:11:52,701 --> 00:11:53,980
我们肯定闯进了蜂窝
We must be near its cave!

327
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:56,140
老天啊 简直是蠢疯了
Oh, my god! There's so much stupid in here!

328
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:57,860
好啦 我这就停车
All right, I'm pulling this thing over.

329
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,360
开成雨刷了
Those are the wipers.

330
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:00,760
克莱尔 帮帮忙
Claire, say something!

331
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,280
孩子们 别闹了
Kids, stop, please.

332
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:06,481
嘿 每天都有航班去黄石公园呢
Hey, there are daily flights to Yellowstone.

333
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:09,160
你把我衣服扯烂了
Aah! You ripped my sweater!

334
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:11,120
是我的衣服 你根本就不该穿
My sweater, which you shouldn't even be wearing!

335
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:14,274
-把衣服还给我 -航班在盐湖城短暂停留
- Get off of my sweater! - Short layover in Salt Lake.

336
00:12:14,274 --> 00:12:16,081
你就一点忙都不帮吗
Are you really not gonna do anything?

337
00:12:16,081 --> 00:12:18,400
菲尔 你肯定早就知道会这样
Oh, Phil, you must have known this was gonna happen.

338
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,700
我听得出来你的语气 你想证明什么
I know that tone. You're making a point.

339
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:23,120
你现在早早发现他们的本性
It's better that you find out who they are now

340
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,780
总比你穿越半个国家了才发现要好
than when you're halfway across the country.

341
00:12:26,098 --> 00:12:27,720
好吧 看来我真是太幼稚
Well, I guess I'm just a naive boob

342
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,980
还以为我们家相亲相爱呢
who thought we liked each other!

343
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,180
显然 这一切都是我的奢望
Obviously, it was too much to ask

344
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:33,360
一家人开开心心地出游
to think that we could take one magnificent trip

345
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,440
享受豪华的房车之旅
in a tricked-out, state-of-the-art R.V.

346
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:37,520
去看太平洋的海上日落
to see the sun dancing off the Pacific.

347
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,360
我真是太强人所难了
What a huge ask!

348
00:12:51,890 --> 00:12:54,110
我受不了大家用这种眼光看着我们
I can't stand the way everyone's starting at us.

349
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,440
我懂 就像我们看别人遛鸟时
Yeah, I know. It's the way we look at people

350
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,760
那种鄙视的眼神
who walk with their pet birds.

351
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,500
小美女来啦
There she is!

352
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:01,100
小宝贝 祝你平衡木成功哦
Hey, good luck on your balance beam routine, sweetie.

353
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:03,120
-你会很棒的 -我永远赢不了莉莉
- You're gonna do great. - I'll never beat lily.

354
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,200
你当然能 因为你是超级小明星
Of course you will, because you're a superstar!

355
00:13:05,442 --> 00:13:07,720
你女儿也是个天才啊 我是她的粉丝
And your daughter's a genius. I am such a fan. Such a fan.

356
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,600
-好吧 你这样太夸张了 -我是迫不得已
- Okay, now you're overcompensating. - I have to!

357
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,540
你也看见我刚刚有多过分
You saw what a monster I was out there.

358
00:13:11,700 --> 00:13:14,760
这恰恰是我恨我爸的一点
This--this is the exact thing I always hated in my dad,

359
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:18,540
他总认为不择手段的强硬真汉子才能赢
that ugly macho testosterone drive to win,

360
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:20,360
今天我自己却也踩进这怪圈了
and today it has flowered in me.

361
00:13:20,381 --> 00:13:22,920
小卡 我今天一定要打破怪圈
Well... No, this ends today, Cam.

362
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,320
我绝不能让莉莉也受到同样的影响
I am not passing this on to Lily.

363
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,890
其实 这也不能全怪你
Well, it's not all on you. You know,

364
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:28,680
我在想 我可能确实故意弄坏了艾比的发型
I'm beginning to think maybe I did sabotage Abby's hair.

365
00:13:28,847 --> 00:13:30,970
我没用定型喷雾 没来个碧昂斯范儿
I didn't spray. I didn't Beyonce.

366
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:33,080
我简直给她梳了个定时炸弹在头上
I basically built a ticking time bun.

367
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:36,180
好吧
Well...

368
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:40,260
你还好吧
Are you okay?

369
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:41,840
不好
No.

370
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:47,080
-我头发扯着疼 -我帮你弄一下
- My hair hurts. - I'll fix it.

371
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:51,960
我们找莉莉去吧
We should find Lily.

372
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,360
你们看见你家女儿干嘛了吗
Did you see what your daughter just did?

373
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,520
莉莉 你把朱莉的发夹拔下来了吗
Uh... Lily, did you pull the pins out of Julie's hair?

374
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,760
是的 她摔了
Yeah, she fell.

375
00:13:59,928 --> 00:14:01,810
好吧
Oh. Okay, um...

376
00:14:01,821 --> 00:14:04,260
大家能听我说两句吗
I--could I get everyone's attention for just a moment?

377
00:14:04,260 --> 00:14:05,940
我们觉得 我家女儿刚刚的行为
We consider what our daughter just did

378
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:08,180
违背了体操运动的体育精神
to be an embarrassment to the sport of gymnastics.

379
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,880
我向你们保证 那绝对不是我们教的
I assure you, she did not learn this from us.

380
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:13,300
而且我们认为 这是弱者的表现
And as far as we are concerned, that is a sign of weakness...

381
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,280
不是胜利者该有的行为 而是
Not the way a winner behaves, but the way...

382
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:17,673
-失败者的行为 -失败者的行为
- A loser behaves. - A loser behaves.

383
00:14:17,940 --> 00:14:19,720
走吧莉莉 我们去拿你的护掌和护腕
Come on, Lily. Let's get your grips and tiger paws.

384
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,800
-你得暂停比赛 -对 要多停一会
- You're going to a time-out. - Yeah. A nice long one.

385
00:14:23,365 --> 00:14:24,132
我进预选队了
I made pre-team,

386
00:14:24,132 --> 00:14:26,909
但我的爸爸们只能在外面观看
and my daddies get to watch from outside.

387
00:14:27,020 --> 00:14:29,040
-必须在100英尺之外 -我们在申诉
- No closer than 100 feet. - But we're appealing.

388
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,000
莉莉太棒了
Yay, Lily!

389
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:36,420
杀死小鸡 酥炸鸡条
Kill the chicken! Chicken fingers!

390
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:37,680
鸽子人
Pigeon man!

391
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,316
鸽子人 鸽子人
Pigeon man? Pigeon man.

392
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:40,820
你看到了吧 托尼 不是我的错
You see, Tony, it's not me.

393
00:14:41,260 --> 00:14:42,460
你会邀请她去游戏之夜吗
Would you invite her to game night?

394
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:43,581
我还是先走吧
I'm gonna go now.

395
00:14:43,709 --> 00:14:46,206
那些要求隔天送达的人都不好伺候
They're kinda sticklers about the next-day delivery thing.

396
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:47,920
一鸟在手[已成定局]
Bird in the hand!

397
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:48,980
这就对了
There you go.

398
00:14:49,349 --> 00:14:50,860
她要再慢点 就堪比美国邮政了
Any slower, she'd be the U.S. Mail,

399
00:14:50,860 --> 00:14:51,300
你说是吧
am I right?

400
00:14:51,628 --> 00:14:53,300
这笑话在我们仓库肯定笑倒一大片
That's gonna kill at the warehouse.

401
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:55,400
看见没 你才是问题
You see? You are the problem.

402
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,840
但你作弊了 我看见你偷瞄那张纸了
Except you cheated. I saw you look at the paper.

403
00:14:57,980 --> 00:14:59,120
我就说嘛
I knew it.

404
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:00,160
你也好不到哪里去
You're no better.

405
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:02,200
大吼大叫 盛气凌人
All the screaming and bullying.

406
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,620
问题不是为什么你们没被邀请
The question isn't why you two weren't invited.

407
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:06,420
而是为什么以前有人愿意邀请你们
It's why you're ever invited.

408
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:09,440
顺便说一句 这画根本与你们无关
And by the way, this isn't even about you.

409
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:11,660
藏宝 箱
Treasure... Chest.

410
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:14,120
我们能不能把这收拾干净 赶紧离开
Now can we clean this place up and go?

411
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:18,720
说来有趣
Funny story.

412
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:20,720
我妈妈和杰其实被邀请了
My mom and Jay were invited.

413
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:22,920
小卡在学校把邀请函交给我
Cam gave me the invitation at school,

414
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:23,980
我把这事忘了
and I forgot about it.

415
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,440
但我怎么能在刚训完话之后就说出实情呢
But how could I tell them right after I'd shamed them?

416
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,860
我得毁灭证据
I had to cover my tracks.

417
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,260
没错 杰 我是作弊了
It's true, Jay. I cheated.

418
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:34,020
每次在游戏之夜我都会小作弊一下
I cheat a little bit every time that we come to the game night.

419
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,140
我觉得上次米奇发现了
I think Mitch saw me the last time,

420
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:38,060
所以他们不想再跟我们玩了
and that's why they don't want to play with us anymore.

421
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,100
你为什么要作弊
But why would you do that?

422
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:40,520
我不知道
I don't know!

423
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:44,280
也许我不想让你认为我笨
Maybe because I don't want you to think that I am not smart.

424
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:45,980
我绝不会那么认为
I would never think that.

425
00:15:46,183 --> 00:15:47,940
再说 这其实是我的错
And besides, it's my fault, anyway.

426
00:15:47,940 --> 00:15:50,360
孩子说得对 我太争强好胜
The kid is right. I'm too competitive.

427
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,820
玩快艇骰子输了一回
Lost a game of yahtzee once.

428
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:52,920
那些骰子现在还被我挂在墙上
The dice are still on the wall.

429
00:15:53,060 --> 00:15:54,520
但至少你没有作弊
Yeah, but at least you're not a cheater.

430
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:56,660
我觉得自己真是个驴嘴巴
I feel like such a donkey mouth.

431
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,800
爹妈 我有事情要告诉你们
Guys, there's something you should know.

432
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,160
妈妈的教堂今晚举办棋盘问答游戏之夜
It's trivial pursuit night at mom's church.

433
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:05,420
我不想让你们错过我的诗歌朗读会
I hate for you to miss my poetry reading,

434
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:07,060
但或许你们可以去教堂
but maybe you could head down there,

435
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:08,200
培养一下公平竞争的体育精神
work on your sportsmanship,

436
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,320
你们就不会那么自责了
And you will feel better about yourselves.

437
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:12,960
你确定我不去你一个人能行吗
Are you sure you're going to be okay without me there?

438
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:15,520
是的 妈妈 妈妈 我上车等你们
Yes, mother. Mother. I'll be in the car.

439
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:19,540
我的过分好胜是从我爸那继承的
I get this damn competitive streak from my old man.

440
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,420
幸好我没有把这传给米奇尔
It's a miracle I didn't pass it down to mitchell.

441
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,340
真高兴我们能把这怪到父母头上
I love that we can blame our parents.

442
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:26,640
我母亲是我见过最爱作弊的大骗子
My mother was the biggest cheater I've ever known.

443
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:29,380
她以前特爱窥探我们的事
And she used to snoop on everything that we did.

444
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,563
杰 看看这个
Ay. Jay, look at this.

445
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:33,860
我们的邀请函
Our invitation.

446
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:35,860
他们肯定是忘给我们了
They must have forgot to give it to us.

447
00:16:35,980 --> 00:16:38,400
不对 我刚进来就检查过这包
No. I checked this bag when we got here,

448
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,959
-当时不在里面 -为什么你总是
- and it wasn't there. - Why are you always--

449
00:16:39,959 --> 00:16:41,724
你知道的 我有问题
'Cause you know I have a problem.

450
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:42,900
这是曼尼干的
This was Manny.

451
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,380
他忘了给我们
He forgot to give it to us,

452
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:48,280
然后就想偷偷地塞进去
and then he came and tried to sneak it in there.

453
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,720
他干嘛不直接告诉我们
Why wouldn't he just tell us?

454
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:53,140
也许因为他不想让我们去朗读会
Maybe because he doesn't want us to go to the reading.

455
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:56,580
所以他才一直说教堂和棋盘游戏的事
That's why he was talking about the church and the game.

456
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:58,900
他把我们耍了
He was working us.

457
00:16:58,900 --> 00:17:00,742
看来他也不是个老好人
Guess he's not too much of a goody two-shoes.

458
00:17:00,742 --> 00:17:04,786
不 他是个爱撒谎 搞诡计的小坏蛋
No. He's a lying, scheming little sneak.

459
00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:07,300
真不愧是我儿子
That's my son.

460
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:08,460
我们的好儿子
Our son.

461
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:12,240
我从没见过爸爸发那么大火
I've never seen dad freak out like that before.

462
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:13,600
我感觉糟透了
I feel terrible.

463
00:17:13,799 --> 00:17:15,640
一部分是我的错
Oh, it's partly my fault.

464
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,900
我引诱你们吵架 以显示我的先见之明
I goaded you guys into a fight to prove a point.

465
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:19,720
我为什么总是要赢
Why do I always have to win?

466
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,440
我是怎么变成这种人的
How did I get this way?

467
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:24,900
那车是你的吗
That you?

468
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:26,660
是的
Yeah.

469
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:28,454
-那车是你的吗 -是的
- You? - Yep.

470
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,820
你车里有几个小孩
How many kids in yours?

471
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,000
感觉像是30个
Felt like 30.

472
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:33,220
我有4个
I got four.

473
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:36,500
不过我打算把其中两个尽早轰出家门
But I'm thinking of emancipating two of them early.

474
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:38,720
但愿你们有香烟或酒
Tell me one of you has cigarettes or a flask.

475
00:17:39,060 --> 00:17:39,820
不好意思 兄弟
Sorry, buddy.

476
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:42,360
我经历过各种情绪[州]
I've been through every state--

477
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:45,480
抑郁 紧张 阿肯色州
Depressed, catatonic, Arkansas.

478
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:48,900
我想过干脆在布莱斯峡谷国家公园假死算了
I considered faking my own death in Bryce Canyon National Park.

479
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,620
你们去过吗 不可错过哦
Have you been? Not to be missed.

480
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,180
我会错过 我会完全错过
I'm gonna miss it. I'm missing every bit of it.

481
00:17:54,303 --> 00:17:57,045
我不会在那辆"移动精神病院"里再待一秒
I'm not spending another second in that rolling asylum.

482
00:17:57,220 --> 00:18:00,060
可怜的家伙 上路多久了 几周吗
Poor guy. How long you been on the road? Couple weeks?

483
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,360
几天
Couple days?

484
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,540
爸正在那边跟超级可怜虫抱团呢
Dad's in the middle of a super sad dude hug.

485
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:11,020
我们真是令他失望了
We really disappointed him.

486
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,060
也许我们应该咬牙忍忍
Yeah, maybe we should just suck it up

487
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:14,320
今年暑假去杰里斯通公园吧
and go to Jellystone this summer.

488
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:17,300
慢着 所以爸才弄了这辆车吗
Wait. That's why dad got this thing?

489
00:18:18,246 --> 00:18:20,138
今年暑假我不能去旅行
I-I can't go on a trip this summer.

490
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:22,360
-为什么 -我有
- Why? - I've...

491
00:18:22,938 --> 00:18:26,751
-我有事 -不行 快说什么事
- I've got stuff. - Huh? No. What stuff?

492
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:28,420
-我不想说 -卢克
- I don't want to talk about it. - Luke.

493
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:31,400
暑期班 我的初级代数挂科了
Summer school. I'm failing pre-algebra.

494
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,660
-你为什么没说 -我不知道
- Why didn't you say something? - I don't know.

495
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:34,720
我觉得好蠢
I feel stupid.

496
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,480
你知道有她在前面做榜样是什么感觉吗
You know what it's like to follow her?

497
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:38,220
所以老师看着我
All the teachers look at me

498
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:40,520
都觉得我像是无理数余数
and think that I'm some kind of irrational remainder.

499
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:43,020
-我这样说对吗 -不对
- Did I use that right? - No.

500
00:18:43,371 --> 00:18:44,605
该死
Dang it.

501
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:47,020
你为什么不问我呢 我可以辅导你
But why didn't you ask me? I would've tutored you.

502
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:50,560
我试过了 不过你总是待在你的房间里
I tried, but you were always off in your room

503
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:52,460
或是家里的角落打电话
or some corner of the house on the phone.

504
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,680
你最近总是和谁讲电话
Yeah, who have you been talking to so much lately?

505
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,720
-亚伦吗 -亚伦是谁
- Aaron? - Who's Aaron?

506
00:18:55,940 --> 00:18:57,400
事实上有两个男生 亚伦和艾历克斯
Actually, it's two boys-- Aaron and Alex.

507
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:59,700
-两个男生 -还有一个和你同名
- Oh, two boys. - A boy named Alex likes you?

508
00:18:59,712 --> 00:19:00,880
我知道 好诡异
Yeah, I know. It's weird.

509
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,660
但我朋友安娣 "女"字旁的 是个女生
But my friend Andi with an "I"-- she's a girl--

510
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:04,240
-也喜欢艾历克斯 -男艾历克斯吗
- Also liked Alex. - The boy?

511
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:06,440
当然是男的 我不会用第三人称来说自己
Yes, the boy. I don't refer to myself in the third person.

512
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,480
-我以为亚伦是第三人 -不
- I thought Aaron was the third person. - No.

513
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,940
总之 我觉得脚踩两条船挺酷的
Anyway, I thought I was cool juggling two boys at once,

514
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:11,340
但是
But...

515
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:13,960
他们在同一天甩了我
They both ended up dumping me on the same day.

516
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:15,960
甜心 那太可怕了
sweetie, that's awful.

517
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,600
我怎么会不知道这些事
How did I not know this was happening?

518
00:19:17,820 --> 00:19:19,540
你最近太忙了
You've been really busy lately,

519
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:21,680
你要翻新房子
like with flipping that house.

520
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,540
而且我并不想谈这个
And plus I didn't really want to talk about it,

521
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:24,860
因为说起来怪丢人的
because it's kind of embarrassing.

522
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:28,989
比不上挂掉以"初级"为名字的课程丢人
Not as embarrassing as failing a class that starts with "Pre."

523
00:19:29,129 --> 00:19:31,021
-宝贝 -你们想好受些吗
- Baby... - You guys wanna feel better?

524
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,920
我今早面试了湖人队的啦啦队员
I auditioned to be a Laker girl this morning.

525
00:19:34,302 --> 00:19:35,840
-什么 真的吗 -不是吧
- What? You did? - No way.

526
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:38,300
我小时候上过舞蹈课
I took all those dance classes when I was younger,

527
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:40,040
我也不知道 我最近想搞清楚
and, I don't know. I've been trying to figure out

528
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,280
我这辈子想做什么
what I want to do with my life,

529
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:43,940
我在网上看到他们有公开选拔赛
So I saw online that there were open tryouts,

530
00:19:43,940 --> 00:19:45,660
-所以我就去了 -然后呢
- so I went down there. - And?

531
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:47,660
我是最新的湖人队啦啦队长 妈
I'm the new head Laker girl, mom.

532
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:50,680
真是场灾难 我是其中最差劲的
It was a disaster. I was the worst one there.

533
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,220
我甚至记不住整套表演动作
I couldn't even get through my routine.

534
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,160
你们有一套表演动作吗
You have a routine?

535
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:59,480
帕特 希斯 你们让我有勇气回去
Pat, Heath, you guys have given me the courage to go back in there,

536
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,440
勇敢面对我妻子
stand up to my wife,

537
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:01,900
告诉她 她一直是对的
and tell her she was right all along.

538
00:20:02,460 --> 00:20:03,420
一路顺风 菲尔
Happy trails, Phil.

539
00:20:04,743 --> 00:20:05,440
希斯
Heath?

540
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,420
我还想继续待一会儿
I might just stay here a while.

541
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,780
菲尔 菲尔 我得告诉你一些事
Phil. Phil, I have to show you something.

542
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:12,840
别得意洋洋 我知道了
Don't gloat. I get it.

543
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:14,700
我尝试令家人亲近
I keep trying to push this family closer together,

544
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,340
-但他们各自需要空间 -不
- but they need their space. - No, no, no.

545
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:17,280
我们的空间太多了
We have too much space.

546
00:20:17,432 --> 00:20:19,460
被困在一间屋子里却令我们
Being in trapped in one room has forced us

547
00:20:19,460 --> 00:20:20,560
能彼此交谈
to actually talk to one another,

548
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:22,900
我发现了孩子们的一些不可思议的事情
and I have found out some incredible things about our kids.

549
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:24,680
等等 不可思议的好吗
Wait. Incredible good?

550
00:20:24,900 --> 00:20:25,760
你说呢
You tell me.

551
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,460
我的天
Oh, my god.

552
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:33,480
梦想成真 我甚至不需要了解来龙去脉
Dream come true! I don't even need context!

553
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:35,540
这是什么情况
What is this?!

554
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:38,500
-我们继续旅行吗 -只要乔琳没意见就行
- So our trip's back on? - We're in if Jolene's in.

555
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,640
-快点来吧 -好耶
- Come on. Do it! - Yeah!

556
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:47,500
为什么我就是不会呢
Why can't I get this?

557
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,660
你需要集中精神 心无杂念
You just gotta focus. Clear your mind.

558
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:51,800
放轻松 进入状态 你会的
Loosen up. Get in the zone. You know this.

559
00:20:52,100 --> 00:20:53,220
我们一起来过一遍
Okay, we're gonna walk through this together,

560
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:54,220
一步步的
step by step.

561
00:20:54,340 --> 00:20:56,820
五六七八
Five, six, seven, eight...

562
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:59,200
一二三四
One, two, three, four,

563
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:02,712
-五六七八 -56.1加上或减去8.25
- Five and six, seven and eight... - 56.1 plus or minus 8.25.

564
00:21:02,966 --> 00:21:04,636
-这是第一题 -一二三四
- That's the first one. - One, two, three, four,

565
00:21:04,636 --> 00:21:06,488
-五六二五 -第二题 X加上2除以4
- Five, six, two, five-- - Okay, number 2-- X plus 2 over 4

566
00:21:06,488 --> 00:21:08,300
-等于3加3 -减 见鬼
- equals 3 plus 3-- - Minus-- damn it,

567
00:21:08,300 --> 00:21:09,440
艾丽克斯 小声点行吗
Alex, do you mind?

568
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,000
我们这里正在做正事呢
We're doing something important here.

569
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:13,420
好了
Okay.

570
00:21:14,360 --> 00:21:16,500
再来一遍 从头开始 就当旁边没人
Once more. From the tippy, like nobody's watching.

571
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:19,620
五六七八 一二
Five, six, seven, eight. One two...
